(text "BFDAC analog board, locked plant (bfdac_cosim112.cir, 2026-09-24). Two identical channels: 64 current cells each (LVC1G74 + DMMT5551 steering) + CORE + P5 TIA + REFS. L: DATnn (J6 -> XLAT sheet AXC8T245) / MCLKnn (FPGA sheet, U302 tree). R: DATRnn (J5/J6 -> XLAT) / MCLKRnn (CLKR sheet, U303 tree). Channel-local nets carry _L/_R; rails, REF5/REF5F and GND are shared. R designators = L + offset (cells 2xxx, refs 7xx, tails Q4xx, core/IV +60)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.000 20.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "254d8b7f-ed3b-410d-a80c-966435dfb95d"))
